From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:05:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix: keep badges in memory

Tele flags were written to cache4.db with the user/chat objects, so clearing the server data or disabling the server left checkmarks behind after a restart. Marked objects now remember their stock flags: storage writes copies carrying them, clearing restores them, and peers dropped from the feed are unmarked. An empty server url turns badges off immediately.
